{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c1b611bf9b1b790f","name":"Crippled","source":{"id":"source:reference-c1b611bf9b1b790f","title":"Crippled","revision":20618,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:11:54Z","sha256":"1373ec916626bd2eaa8d3ae12ef3fe71445db197e60d6da363d7e2810e652343","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20618","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Crippled&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c1b611bf9b1b790f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You were crippled or seriously wounded in some way, but you have overcome the effects of that injury to become a hero. Perhaps you were blasted and left for dead by a bounty hunter on the Empire's payroll, or you were critically injured when ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshan","referenceId":"reference:7462eb9a66c70e5d"}," slavers raided your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},". The event that left you wounded was a major catalyst for your transformation into a hero, and it has had lasting physical repercussions.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Relevant Skills:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Enhancement:"]}," As a result of your injury, you begin play with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cybernetic Prosthesis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cybernetic_Prosthesis","referenceId":"reference:06abec99ed18263b"}," at no additional cost. In addition, you have learned to fight through the pain of being wounded. When your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," is reduced as a result of moving down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," remains the same, as if you had no debilitating ",{"tag":"a","children":["Conditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Conditions","referenceId":"reference:97d4be8960698f97"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
